{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39935","headline":"东京次新安道中 · 徐夤","name":"东京次新安道中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贼去兵来岁月长，野蒿空满坏墙匡。\n旋从古辙成深谷，几见金舆过上阳。\n洛水送年催代谢，嵩山擎日拂穹苍。\n殊时异世爲儒者，不见文皇与武皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}